,{"text":"update","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"elapsed","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Duration","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Advances the simulation by one frame.","type":"text"}]},"doc://SimulationModule/documentation/SimulationModule/Simulation":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/simulationmodule\/simulation","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"Simulation","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Simulation"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SimulationModule\/documentation\/SimulationModule\/Simulation","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Simulation"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A world and its schedules by label, advanced one frame at a time.","type":"text"}]},"doc://SimulationModule/documentation/SimulationModule/ScheduleLabel":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The name of a schedule in a simulation."}],"type":"topic","title":"ScheduleLabel","url":"\/documentation\/simulationmodule\/schedulelabel","identifier":"doc:\/\/SimulationModule\/documentation\/SimulationModule\/ScheduleLabel","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScheduleLabel"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScheduleLabel"}]},"doc://SimulationModule/documentation/SimulationModule/inState(_:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a run condition that holds when a world’s current state is the given state."}],"type":"topic","title":"inState(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/SimulationModule\/documentation\/SimulationModule\/inState(_:)","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/simulationmodule\/instate(_:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"inState"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","t